<BaseLayout title="Privacy Information | FenceCraft" description="Privacy information for FenceCraft enquiries and contact details.">
  <section class="wrap page-title"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p><h1>Privacy information.</h1><p class="intro">We use the details you choose to share to understand and respond to your enquiry.</p></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap narrow editorial"><h2>Enquiries</h2><p>When the enquiry service is connected, FenceCraft will receive the name, postcode, service, project description and preferred contact method you submit. Park enquiries may also include the park or site location, approximate scope and preferred timing.</p><p>The final enquiry provider, lawful basis, retention period and access arrangements still need to be confirmed by the business owner before the form is enabled for live delivery.</p><h2>Contact alternatives</h2><p>You can call <a href="tel:+447935190681">07935 190681</a> or email <a href="mailto:info@fence-craft.co.uk">info@fence-craft.co.uk</a> instead.</p><h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>No analytics or advertising cookies are included in this site.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
